{"id": "ev-d380026bb3f6", "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/resource/evolution-of-a-martian-sojourner-to-perseverance/", "date": "2024-11-25", "coverage": "Evolution of NASA’s Mars Rovers: Sojourner to Perseverance - NASA Science", "excerpt": "NASA has pushed the boundaries of exploration with increasingly larger and more sophisticated robotic explorers. Each mission builds on the lessons learned from the Red Planet, leading to breakthroughs in technology and our understanding of Mars. From the microwave-sized Sojourner to the SUV-sized Perseverance—and even taking flight with the groundbreaking Ingenuity helicopter—these rovers reflect", "limitation": "网页存档（curl），只用于所引数字/事实；日期为页面发布或检索所示日期，未注明者为 null", "local_archive": "data/sources/d380026bb3f6.json", "sha256": "8d22144704ceb59ba71371c5415d0b2532bba0d3d29c30d2778a7536bacf6bf1", "verified": true}
